      "message": "Hey. Instead of expanding the API for testing, I have a different suggestion.\n\nYou should add:\n\"friend class SkArenaAllocTestingPeer\" to SkArenaAlloc\n\"friend class SkArenaAllocWithRestTestPeer\" to SkArenaAllocWithReset\n\nIn your test you can then define classes that reach into the private parts of\nSkArenaAlloc* and do what ever you want. I have done this with a few other classes,\nand it keeps the API small, and allows simple flexibility with out having to change existing implementation.\n\nWhat do you think?",
